y checked before it hits your spreadsheet.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Direct phone numbers</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Direct dial and mobile numbers verified against carrier databases. Get the numbers that actually ring, not a company switchboard.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Employee count &amp; company size</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Current headcount pulled from social profiles and other sources. Not the &#x27;10-50 employees&#x27; range you get from static databases, actual numbers, updated in real time.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Tech stack</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">See what CRM, marketing automation, analytics, e-commerce platform, and other tools a company uses. Filter leads by whether they use a competitor&#x27;s product or a complementary tool.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Funding history</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Funding rounds, amounts, investors, and dates. Know if a company just raised a Series B or bootstrapped to profitability, and what that means for their buying power.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Custom AI research</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Ask for literally any data point: &#x27;Do they have a mobile app?&#x27;, &#x27;What&#x27;s their pricing model?&#x27;, &#x27;When did the CEO join?&#x27; Origami researches the web per row and fills in the answer.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-white pt-16 pb-20 md:pt-20 md:pb-28"><div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#09090b]/40 mb-8 md:mb-10" style="opacity:0">[02] Workflows</p><div class="max-w-[800px] mb-10 md:mb-14" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-medium text-[#09090b] leading-[1.15] tracking-tight">From an incomplete list to researched accounts.</h2></div><div class="space-y-0 border border-[#e4e4e7] divide-y divide-[#e4e4e7]"><div class="group p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:shadow-[inset_4px_0_0_0_#FE7BCD]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#a1a1aa] mb-1 block">01</span><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b]">Enrich leads you just found</h3></div><div class="md:flex-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-3">After Origami populates your spreadsheet with leads, ask it to add columns. &#x27;Add their work email and phone number.&#x27; &#x27;Add what CRM they use.&#x27; Each column runs automatically on every row.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-[#e4e4e7] text-[12px] text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">Example:</span><span class="italic">“<!-- -->Add verified email, phone number, and employee count for each company<!-- -->”</span></div></div></div></div><div class="group p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:shadow-[inset_4px_0_0_0_#FE7BCD]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#a1a1aa] mb-1 block">02</span><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b]">Upload a CSV and fill in the gaps</h3></div><div class="md:flex-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-3">Upload an existing list and request the fields you need. Fictional example: start with Acme Supply and acme.example; after research, the row might include an employee count, a CRM, and a contact-verification status. This illustrates the workflow, not a guaranteed result: unavailable fields can remain blank.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-[#e4e4e7] text-[12px] text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">Example:</span><span class="italic">“<!-- -->Here&#x27;s my list of 500 accounts, add tech stack, recent funding, and decision-maker emails<!-- -->”</span></div></div></div></div><div class="group p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:shadow-[inset_4px_0_0_0_#FE7BCD]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#a1a1aa] mb-1 block">03</span><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b]">Custom research at scale</h3></div><div class="md:flex-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-3">Need a data point that no standard enrichment tool offers? Origami&#x27;s AI researches the web for each row individually. It&#x27;s like having an intern Google every company on your list, except it takes seconds, not days.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-[#e4e4e7] text-[12px] text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">Example:</span><span class="italic">“<!-- -->For each company, find out if they have a loyalty or rewards program<!-- -->”</span></div></div></div></div><div class="group p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:shadow-[inset_4px_0_0_0_#FE7BCD]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#a1a1aa] mb-1 block">04</span><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b]">Score and filter after enriching</h3></div><div class="md:flex-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-3">Once your data is enriched, set relevance conditions, like &#x27;must have 50+ employees&#x27; or &#x27;must use Shopify&#x27;, and Origami scores every row. Filter to only qualified leads, then export a clean CSV.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-[#e4e4e7] text-[12px] text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">Example:</span><span cla